      "en": "This coursework evaluates how a learner explains, analyses and demonstrates using change of character as evidence, not a standalone entry using objective chart evidence, explicit invalidation and controlled risk.",
      "zh": "本课程作业评估学习者如何运用客观图表证据、明确失效条件与受控风险来解释、分析并展示将结构转变作为证据而非独立入场信号。"
    },
