      "order": 4,
      "type": "self_analysis_kbat",
      "title": {
        "en": "Independent Scenario Analysis: Change of Character",
        "zh": "独立情境分析：将结构转变作为证据而非独立入场信号"
      },
      "prompt": {
        "en": "Analyse both a valid and an invalid interpretation of using change of character as evidence, not a standalone entry using the assigned chart. Compare the evidence, explain the risk boundary, identify what would change your conclusion and state when no trade is preferable.",
